                  "text": "Ezek 34:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kyabazinga ali ng'oti n'omugheereza wange Daudi, n'aja okubafuganga boonaboona, nga bali ng'oti ntaama edhiriku omwayi omulala. Baidha kukuumanga ebiragiro byange era bajiirenga ku mateeka gange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baliba mu nsi ye nagha Yakobo omugheereza wange, ensi badhaadha baibwe mwe baabanga. Beene, n'abaana baibwe, ni baidhukulu baibwe, omwo mwe baliba ebyanda n'ebyanda. Era kyabazinga ali ng'oti n'omugheereza wange Daudi, n'aja okubafuganga ebyanda n'ebyanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndikola nabo endagaano ey'emiraala etawaagho byanda na byanda. Naabagha enkabi beeyongera obungi, era naabataamu eisinzizo lyange libabeemu ebyanda n'ebyanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
